n parent Payward adds 200 tokenized UK and European equities to xStocks offering</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/11/10/emb-10-am-et-plume-affiliate-gets-the-legal-green-light-to-trade-regulated-security-entitlements-onchain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plume affiliate lands broker-dealer license to bring real U.S. assets onchain</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
